  "script": "-- Project script. Runs again whenever it changes.\n-- mf.signal(name, fn) defines a reactive signal; read it as sig.name.\n-- Read time as t. See the meshframe skill for the full API.\n\nmf.signal(\"pulse\", function()\n  return 0.5 + 0.5 * math.sin(t * math.pi * 2)\nend)\n",
